;;; exc-obsolete.el --- Old grid-table names, kept working  -*- lexical-binding: t -*-

;;; Commentary:

;; Every name this package defined before it was renamed, aliased to the
;; name it has now and marked obsolete as of 0.5.1.
;;
;; This file requires nothing, on purpose: a file that defines one of the
;; new variables loads it before its own `defvar', so a value a user put
;; on the old name in their init file reaches the new name instead of
;; being overwritten by the new name's default.
;;
;; Written in one pass when the package was renamed.  An alias added
;; later is written by hand, in the same form.

;;; Code:

